{
  "title": "Travel and transport",
  "note": "で also marks the means: バスで行きます \"I go by bus.\" On foot is 歩いて, with no で. から means \"from\" and まで \"to, as far as\": 家から駅まで. You ride something with に: 電車に乗ります. Get off uses を: 電車を降ります.",
